('broadening-formation', 'Broadening Formation', 'The distribution of traded prices widens rather than compresses.

Interpretation
expansion · neutral

Context
In a volatile range or near a possible transition.

Recognition
• Boundaries diverge.
• common megaphone has higher highs and lower lows.
• tilted variants may rise or fall.

Confirmation to study
Boundary break with follow-through; direction is unresolved beforehand.

What weakens the scenario
Rapid return inside the expanding range.

Target framework
The shape supplies no reliable fixed target. In a hypothetical study, compare nearby opposing support or resistance with the planned risk distance.

Common mistakes and limitations
• Large swings create wide risk distances and do not prove manipulation.

Also called
• Megaphone

Variants
• Ascending broadening structures have two rising, diverging boundaries. Descending broadening structures have two falling, diverging boundaries. The horizontal megaphone expands in both directions.

Timeframe
Use completed candles from one consistent timeframe. Session boundaries, liquidity, costs and noise affect interpretation.

